OL,3,ATrump to speak to Putin about plague
OL,4,Alab worker's death in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian officials say they are
OL,7,Finvestigating the cause of the
OL,8,F28-year-old's death. They say that
OL,9,Fthose who came into contact with the
OL,10,Fvictim all tested negative and have not
OL,11,Fconfirmed that the suspected disease is
OL,12,Fpneumonic plague - a serious lung
OL,13,Finfection, often described as the most
OL,14,Fvirulent form of plague.
OL,16,FThe head of the World Health
OL,17,FOrganization (WHO) has called for
OL,18,Ftransparency from Russia.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
